      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Hearing Testimony & Eyewitness Account\n\nHost reviews a campus-safety officer's hearing testimony about items found near a UVU library, and shares a purported eyewitness's description of a rooftop figure's clothing and movements, which the host contrasts with official statements. These are the host's characterizations and an unverified secondhand account, not established facts.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
