    {
      "id": "7e9c35d6-fc68-4dd0-b12a-f5978bf87d14",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Widow's Interview Statement",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": 1290,
        "y": 561.8217818852415
      },
      "width": 320,
      "height": 220,
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "parent-in",
          "label": "parent",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "value",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "parent-in",
          "label": "parent",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "value",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "parent-in",
          "label": "parent",
          "type": "value"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "style": {
        "background": "#fef2f2",
        "color": "#7f1d1d",
        "borderColor": "#ef4444",
        "borderWidth": 1,
        "borderRadius": 10
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "In a televised interview, the victim's widow states she doesn't believe there was a second shooter but believes the shooter was working with someone, and describes it as an inside job — her stated personal belief, not a confirmed investigative finding.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "e2998c24-2b3b-4ecf-af85-e105ac64fafc"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "layout",
          "updatedAt": 1784172253927,
          "reason": "auto-layout"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "40c0a131-b558-4bc8-86d6-9ee8f3b740b5",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Timeline of Contact",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": 869.9999999999999,
        "y": 561.8217818852415
      },
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "parent-in",
          "label": "parent",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "value",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "parent-in",
          "label": "parent",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "value",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "parent-in",
          "label": "parent",
          "type": "value"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "style": {
        "background": "#fef2f2",
        "color": "#7f1d1d",
        "borderColor": "#ef4444",
        "borderWidth": 1,
        "borderRadius": 10
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "Widow states it took roughly a year for the relevant protective agency to contact her, that her questions weren't fully answered, and that she is asking the President to help get further answers.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "e2998c24-2b3b-4ecf-af85-e105ac64fafc"
